  "description": {
   "en": "The beautiful princess from the kingdom of Ayos began a new chapter in her life when she married the crown prince of the Irene Empire in a political marriage meant to save her homeland from financial ruin.\nHer husband, the prince, seemed gentle and kind despite her painful past—but she soon discovered there was another side to him: he was actually the commander of the elite Wolf Unit, and his true nature was far more mysterious and cunning than she ever imagined.\nThus, she found herself swept up in a romantic story full of secrets and surprises in a foreign land."
  },
